    <item>
      <title>०२</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/08_petvAnuvachanam/02/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/08_petvAnuvachanam/02/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;लोमशसक्थौ&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; शितिपृष्ठौ बार्हस्पत्यौ धात्रे पृषोदरस्सौर्यो&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:2&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:2&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; बलक्षः&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:3&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:3&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; पेत्वः॥२॥ cf. TS 5, 5, 23; MS 3, 13, 2; VS 24, 1.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;footnotes&#34; role=&#34;doc-endnotes&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li id=&#34;fn:1&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;So corr. Ch सक्ती (Thus emended; Ch reads सक्ती)&amp;#160;&lt;a href=&#34;#fnref:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-backref&#34; role=&#34;doc-backlink&#34;&gt;&amp;#x21a9;&amp;#xfe0e;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li id=&#34;fn:2&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;So corr. Ch पृशोदर॰; vgl. TS 5, 5, 23 पृषोदर; und auch Ch liest weiter unten 5, 9, 4 पृषोदराः (Thus emended; Ch reads पृशोदर॰; cf. TS 5, 5, 23 reads पृषोदर; and Ch also reads further below 5, 9, 4 पृषोदराः)&amp;#160;&lt;a href=&#34;#fnref:2&#34; class=&#34;footnote-backref&#34; role=&#34;doc-backlink&#34;&gt;&amp;#x21a9;&amp;#xfe0e;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>०३</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/08_petvAnuvachanam/03/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/kAThakam/kaTha-kapiShTalAH/saMhitA/mUlam/schroeder/5_ashvamedhaH/08_petvAnuvachanam/03/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;अग्नयेऽनीकवते रोहिताञ्जिरनड्वानधोरामौ सावित्रौ पौष्णो रजतनाभी वैश्वदेवौ पि‍शङ्गौ तूपरौ&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; मारुतः कल्माष आग्नेयः कृष्णोऽजस्सारस्वती मेषी वारुणः कृष्ण एकशितिपात्पेत्वः॥३॥&#xA;cf. TS 5, 5, 24; VS 29, 59.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;इति पेत्वानुवचनमष्टमम्&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:2&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:2&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;footnotes&#34; role=&#34;doc-endnotes&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li id=&#34;fn:1&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;So corr. Ch रूपरो; vgl. TS 5, 5, 24; VS 29, 59. (Thus emended; Ch reads रूपरो; cf. TS 5, 5, 24; VS 29, 59)&amp;#160;&lt;a href=&#34;#fnref:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-backref&#34; role=&#34;doc-backlink&#34;&gt;&amp;#x21a9;&amp;#xfe0e;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li id=&#34;fn:2&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Ch पेत्वनु॰&amp;#160;&lt;a href=&#34;#fnref:2&#34; class=&#34;footnote-backref&#34; role=&#34;doc-backlink&#34;&gt;&amp;#x21a9;&amp;#xfe0e;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
